From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000060 Mon Sep 17 00:0:00 2001
From: husky-port CI <ci@husky-port.local>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 10:05:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] display: hk3: WQHD-only diagnostic - hide FHD panel modes

Second diagnostic for the bottom-band display artifact on husky
(alternative to force-60Hz). Wrap both 1008x2244 entries of hk3_modes
in #if 0 and also hide the 120Hz WQHD entry, so the panel exposes only
1344x2992x60 (PREFERRED); ARRAY_SIZE(hk3_modes) adjusts automatically.
Toggle: delete the three #if 0 / #endif pairs.

If the artifact clears at WQHD60 but persists at FHD60 (force-60Hz
branch), the FHD DSC path (12x187 slices, PPS via composer3) is
implicated; if it persists at both resolutions, resolution-independent
causes (GIDLE/self-refresh, TE2) remain.

Test branch only (test-display-wqhd); do not merge to the r8
known-good baseline.
---
diff --git a/google/shusky/display/panel-google-hk3.c b/google/shusky/display/panel-google-hk3.c
index 7428bb5..2360835 100644
--- a/google/shusky/display/panel-google-hk3.c
+++ b/google/shusky/display/panel-google-hk3.c
@@ -2487,6 +2487,7 @@ static const struct exynos_panel_mode hk3_modes[] = {
 		.idle_mode = IDLE_MODE_ON_INACTIVITY,
 	},
 #ifndef PANEL_FACTORY_BUILD
+#if 0 /* HUSKY_DIAG wqhd-only: hide FHD modes (bottom-band artifact experiment) */
 	{
 		.mode = {
 			.name = "1008x2244x60",
@@ -2516,6 +2517,8 @@ static const struct exynos_panel_mode hk3_modes[] = {
 		},
 		.idle_mode = IDLE_MODE_ON_SELF_REFRESH,
 	},
+#endif /* HUSKY_DIAG wqhd-only (FHD hidden) */
+#if 0 /* HUSKY_DIAG wqhd-only: hide 120Hz WQHD too — lock WQHD60 baseline */
 	{
 		.mode = {
 			.name = "1008x2244x120",
@@ -2546,6 +2549,7 @@ static const struct exynos_panel_mode hk3_modes[] = {
 		},
 		.idle_mode = IDLE_MODE_ON_INACTIVITY,
 	},
+#endif /* HUSKY_DIAG wqhd-only */
 #endif
 };
 
